=== Objective Measurement and Fatigability

<subsec:fatigue-objective-measurement>

Subjective fatigue scales measure what patients report; objective correlates — actigraphy-based activity and neurophysiological fatigability — measure what patients do. These provide independent evidence that fatigue and fatigability have measurable biological and behavioral substrates.

